    "scenesThatPass": [
      "LAURA: Why don’t you eat that one first?\nTHEO: I don’t like it.\nLAURA: What’s not to like?",
      "DIANE: How’s your book coming along?\nLAURA: I need to get back to it....\nLAURA: Hi, Gran, how are you?",
      "LAURA: I don’t know, yes, she’s attractive, but New York is filled with attractive women...\nAMANDA: Well, ok...\nAMANDA: Laura, you know you could teach them something about aesthetics. Do you really want them growing up with pink lycra all the time?\nLAURA: They’re little, so what if they pick out their clothes. It’s not worth fighting with them about.",
      "THEO: I think so.\nLAURA: Can I use your phone, I want to send that cute picture of the girls to my mom -- did you change your password?",
      "VANESSA: My therapist says I have no self worth.\nLAURA: Oh, no."
    ]
